<section class="content-section"><div class="container content-narrow"><h2 data-en="What is EduBooks?" data-ar="ما هو EduBooks؟">What is EduBooks?</h2><p data-en="EduBooks is an independent digital educational publishing project. The library is being prepared and products are not yet available." data-ar="EduBooks مشروع نشر تعليمي رقمي مستقل. المكتبة قيد الإعداد والمنتجات غير متاحة للبيع حالياً.">EduBooks is an independent digital educational publishing project. The library is being prepared and products are not yet available.</p><h2 data-en="What subjects will be covered?" data-ar="ما المجالات التي ستغطيها المكتبة؟">What subjects will be covered?</h2><p data-en="Planned areas include language learning, school learning, academic guides, teacher resources, early learning and lifelong learning." data-ar="تشمل المجالات المخطط لها تعلم اللغات والتعليم المدرسي والأدلة الأكاديمية وموارد المعلمين والتعلم المبكر والتعلم مدى الحياة.">Planned areas include language learning, school learning, academic guides, teacher resources, early learning and lifelong learning.</p><h2 data-en="How can I contact EduBooks?" data-ar="كيف يمكنني التواصل مع EduBooks؟">How can I contact EduBooks?</h2><p data-en="A verified contact channel will be published before the public launch." data-ar="سيتم نشر قناة تواصل موثوقة قبل الإطلاق العام.">A verified contact channel will be published before the public launch.</p></div></section>
